<title>HONG KONG: Beijing Yanhua debuts at HK$1.70/share.</title>
<headline>Beijing Yanhua debuts at HK$1.70/share.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Beijing Yanhua Petrochemical Co Ltd made their trading debut on Wednesday at HK$1.70 per share, down from the issue price of HK$1.76.</p>
</text>
